{"id":"ac9dde66604507b2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-open-determinacy.md","title":"开放博弈确定性","display":"thm-open-determinacy — 开放博弈确定性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-open-determinacy","aliases":["20-thm-open-determinacy"],"display":"thm-open-determinacy — 开放博弈确定性","chapter":"15","section":"15.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 15.1.1","source_pdf_pages":[246,247],"source_printed_pages":[217,218],"depends_on":["[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","[[20-df-cantor-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-open-determinacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-open-determinacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-open-determinacy — 开放博弈确定性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"15"},{"key":"section","html":"15.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 15.1.1"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>246</span><span>247</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>217</span><span>218</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span> 为开集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不要求有效。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" href=\"?note=f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab\" title=\"20-df-gale-stewart\">20-df-gale-stewart</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ef101d71722ee067\" href=\"?note=ef101d71722ee067\" title=\"20-df-cantor-space\">20-df-cantor-space</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\lor\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\lor\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0=\\{\\sigma:\\exists\\rho\\in S\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\}\">\\(B_0=\\{\\sigma:\\exists\\rho\\in S\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\}\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_{n+1}\">\\(B_{n+1}\\)</span> 包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n\">\\(B_n\\)</span> 及以下前缀：偶数长度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 有一个子节点在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n\">\\(B_n\\)</span>；奇数长度的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 两个子节点都在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_n\">\\(B_n\\)</span>。置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\bigcup_nB_n\">\\(B=\\bigcup_nB_n\\)</span>。因为每条闭包规则仅有有限多个前提，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 已对两条规则闭合，不需要超限阶段。</p>\n<p>若根在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，给每个胜区节点取最小入区阶段为自然数秩。偶数节点由 I 选择秩更小的子节点；奇数节点对手的两个选择都可落入更小秩。沿对局秩下降，有限步到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0\">\\(B_0\\)</span>，即出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 前缀。将这个有限胜局树内的行动写表，其他 I 历史任选默认行动，就得全策略。</p>\n<p>若根不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，偶数节点两个孩子均在区外，奇数节点至少一个孩子在区外。II 始终选择区外孩子；任何对手行动都保持区外，所以永不出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 前缀。对区内的不可达 II 历史任取默认位，得到全策略。以上两种情形证明确定性；这利用二值行动的有限分支，不将无穷分支博弈误归为有限闭包。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 15.1.1；印刷 217–218 / PDF 246–247。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-gale-stewart]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-gale-stewart","status":"resolved","id":"f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-space","status":"resolved","id":"ef101d71722ee067","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-gale-stewart]]；see [[20-df-cantor-space]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A=\\bigcup_{\\rho\\in S}[\\rho]\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}open\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_I(s,A))\\lor\n(\\exists s\\ \\operatorname{Win}_{II}(s,A)).","display":true},{"tex":"B_0=\\{\\sigma:\\exists\\rho\\in S\\ (\\rho\\preceq\\sigma)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B_{n+1}","display":false},{"tex":"B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B_n","display":false},{"tex":"B=\\bigcup_nB_n","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"B_0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false}],"bytes":2023,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f4b3e6ff9a44d1ab","ef101d71722ee067"]}